### 1. Direct lookup - zero AI tokens
GET http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders/ORD-1001/status

### 2. General chat - no tools
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Explain incident severity in two sentences."
}

### 3. Natural-language order chat - tool enabled
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/orders/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What is the status of ORD-1002?"
}

### 4. Structured incident classification
POST http://localhost:8081/api/v1/incidents/classify
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "A duplicate payment was posted for an order."
}
